  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 932279,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 0 Blocks Free: A Festive C64 Challenge\n\nStep into a frantic, pixelated Christmas Eve in *0 Blocks Free* for the Commodore 64! Santa's in a rush, and it's your job to help him deliver presents before the moon disappears. Navigate a charming, yet perilous, landscape, carefully dropping parcels down chimneys to spread Christmas cheer. \n\nBut beware! The night is full of obstacles. Chinese lanterns float menacingly, bats swoop down to disrupt your deliveries, and sneaky burglars are determined to ruin the holiday spirit. Precise timing and quick reflexes are essential to avoid these hazards and successfully complete each delivery. \n\n*0 Blocks Free* offers a simple premise with surprisingly addictive gameplay. The game's retro graphics and catchy chiptune soundtrack perfectly capture the nostalgic feel of classic Commodore 64 titles. Can you master Santa’s deliveries and save Christmas? Test your skills and see how many parcels you can drop before time runs out!"
    },
